      <Comment source="pmngroup">The CesA8 mutants have reduced cellulose content. The mutants have irregular xylem cell shape. All the evidence suggests that this cellulose synthase isoform is involved in the secondary cell wall cellulose synthesis.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="MONOMER-2366" />
      <Property key="Synonym_1" value="cellulose synthase" />
